her experiment combin- ing EDC and Schema Definition on REBEL using GPT-3.5-turbo, we observed slight performance gains (0.516 to 0.518 under the ‘Partial’ criteria) and token cost reduction (≈3k to 2k tokens per example)."},{"id":"c17","chunkId":"6c24762a3f277fd1_c_b8bf8852dd017519","docId":"6c24762a3f277fd1","docTitle":"2309.15217_Ragas_Automated_Evaluation_of_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":5,"quote":"The second baseline, shown as GPT Ranking, in- stead asks ChatGPT to select the preferred answer/- context."},{"id":"c18","chunkId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3_c_d89e09abbf153060","docId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3","docTitle":"2404.03868_Extract_Define_Canonicalize_An_LLM_based_Framework_for_Knowledge_Graph","page":17,"quote":"The LLM used for OIE is GPT-3.5-turbo."},{"id":"c19","chunkId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17_c_e9732f9586d9dbaa","docId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17","docTitle":"2304.09542_Is_ChatGPT_Good_at_Search_Investigating_Large_Language_Models_as_Re_Ra","page":5,"quote":"sing ChatGPT and GPT-4 with permutation generation."},{"id":"c20","chunkId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17_c_d5c0d7fadb9ac7a5","docId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17","docTitle":"2304.09542_Is_ChatGPT_Good_at_Search_Investigating_Large_Language_Models_as_Re_Ra","page":8,"quote":"otes use the outputs of permutation generation instructed ChatGPT as labels."},{"id":"c21","chunkId":"d9eaa1398abac0df_c_758b614bf81c1f4c","docId":"d9eaa1398abac0df","docTitle":"2310.11511_Self_RAG_Learning_to_Retrieve_Generate_and_Critique_through_Self_Refle","page":11,"quote":"Lingjiao Chen, Matei Zaharia, and James Zou. How is chatgpt’s behavior changing over time?"},{"id":"c22","chunkId":"6c24762a3f277fd1_c_406b010c9a057b34","docId":"6c24762a3f277fd1","docTitle":"2309.15217_Ragas_Automated_Evaluation_of_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":2,"quote":"An- other approach directly asks ChatGPT to evaluate a particular aspect of the given answer by provid- ing a score between 0 and 100, or by providing a rating on a 5-star scale (Wang et al., 2023a)."},{"id":"c23","c